{#
tasks/index.html.twig — the tasks at full size: the mailbox, with the mail column
put away and the tasks dock given the row.

What a phone gets from the topbar and the drawer, where there is no dock, and what
a middle click gets anywhere. `data-tasks-full` on the shell is the whole
difference from a mailbox with the pane open (see app.css), the same shape as
contacts/_page_shell.html.twig. No list is rendered behind it, and it is said to be
empty, so one is fetched the first time it is wanted.
#}
{% extends '_layout/_mailbox.html.twig' %}

{% set tasksFull = true %}

{% block title %}{{ 'tasks.title'|trans }}{% endblock %}
{% block message_list %}{% endblock %}
{% block inbox_tabs %}{% endblock %}
{% block list_rendered %}0{% endblock %}

{% block tasks_dock %}
    {% set tasksPaneBody %}{% include 'tasks/_pane_frame.html.twig' %}{% endset %}
    {% include '_partials/_tasks_pane.html.twig' with { tasksPaneBody: tasksPaneBody } %}
{% endblock %}
